an Evaluation Benchmark Cheater\",\n  \"paper_id\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.01964\",\n  \"query\": \"Exact permitted canonical record: Don't Make Your LLM an Evaluation Benchmark Cheater\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.01964\",\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-17\",\n  \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.01964\",\n  \"source\": \"arxiv\",\n  \"evidence_path\": \"literature/Cheater.json\",\n  \"sha256\": \"ded49285eb81268cf475b2fb4a16debae689850ec28eee8b282c7ff472768744\",\n  \"reading_scope\": \"Canonical record metadata and abstract only; no citation graph or related links followed.\"\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"Rephrased\",\n  \"citation_key\": \"Rephrased\",\n  \"title\": \"Rethinking Benchmark and Contamination for Language Models with Rephrased Samples\",\n  \"paper_id\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.04850\",\n  \"query\": \"Exact permitted canonical record: Rethinking Benchmark and Contamination for Language Models with Rephrased Samples\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.04850\",\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-17\",\n  \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.04850\",\n  \"source\": \"arxiv\",\n  \"evidence_path\": \"literature/Rephrased.json\",\n  \"sha256\": \"17861eccb35819766636339e10faa9d6b1bd3cf88b662e3ba84071badd70e80f\",\n  \"reading_scope\": \"Canonical record metadata and abstract only; no citation graph or related links followed.\"\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"GPQA\",\n  \"citation_key\": \"GPQA\",\n  \"title\": \"GPQA: A Graduate-Level Google-Proof Q&A Benchmark\",\n  \"paper_id\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.12022\",\n  \"query\": \"Exact permitted canonical record: GPQA: A Graduate-Level Google-Proof Q&A Benchmark\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.12022\",\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-17\",\n  \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.12022\",\n  \"source\": \"arxiv\",\n  \"evidence_path\": \"literature/GPQA.json\",\n  \"sha256\": \"0feba268d4c8421b12ba2c5da63e443679671ec60f0631137bb291bfe2e88cba\",\n  \"reading_scope\": \"Canonical record metadata and abstract only; no citation graph or related links followed.\"\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"IFEval\",\n  \"citation_key\": \"IFEval\",\n  \"title\": \"Instruction-Following Evaluation for Large Language Models\",\n  \"paper_id\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.07911\",\n  \"query\": \"Exact permitted canonical record: Instruction-Following Evaluation for Large Language Models\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.07911\",\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-17\",\n  \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.07911\",\n  \"source\": \"arxiv\",\n  \"evidence_path\": \"literature/IFEval.json\",\n  \"sha256\": \"da68374ae76e5e84c4d787175c71ff7d00f02ad969ef089900eef6e356250b4e\",\n  \"reading_scope\": \"Canonical record metadata and abstract only; no citation graph or related links followed.\"\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"MMLUPro\",\n  \"citation_key\": \"MMLUPro\",\n  \"title\": \"MMLU-Pro: A More Robust and Challenging Multi-Task Language Understanding Benchmark\",\n  \"paper_id\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01574\",\n  \"query\": \"Exact permitted canonical record: MMLU-Pro: A More Robust and Challenging Multi-Task Language Understanding Benchmark\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01574\",\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-17\",\n  \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01574\",\n  \"source\": \"arxiv\",\n  \"evidence_path\": \"literature/MMLUPro.json\",\n  \"sha256\": \"4a318fab24768565f438efa4ad25aee666d9e8c4099dd632e00789481f378db7\",\n  \"reading_scope\": \"Canonical record metadata and abstract only; no citation graph or related links followed.\"\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"MATH\",\n  \"citation_key\": \"MATH\",\n  \"title\": \"Measuring Mathematical Problem Solving With the MATH Dataset\",\n  \"paper_id\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.03874\",\n  \"query\": \"Exact permitted canonical record: Measuring Mathematical Problem Solving With the MATH Dataset\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.03874\",\n  \"retrieved_at\": \"